				<node id="TranslatedStringKey">
					<!-- Destroying this tombstone will anger the Spirits of the Forge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Turns on Grym's anti-cheese/hard mode. Killing Grym in this mode rewards you with a pet.&lt;br&gt;Note: the ghosts are supposed to be invulnerable, and they will die with Grym.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This cannot be undone. Save prior to destroying this tombstone and attempting the encounter. -->
